<speak>
<break time="400ms"/>
<mark name="b1_provoke"/>
Every keystroke your engineers send to Copilot, Cursor, or ChatGPT is a round trip to someone else's datacenter.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="b2_what"/>
Pricing engines. Patient data. Claims processors. Logged, cached, used to train the models that answer your competitors.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="b3_bill"/>
HIPAA. SOX. GDPR. FedRAMP. "Accept all" was the wrong button.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="b4_pivot"/>
So we built it differently.
<break time="400ms"/>
<mark name="b5_arch"/>
OutcomeOps runs inside your AWS account — your Bedrock, your keys, your logs. No egress, no shadow cache, no training on your code.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="b6_numbers"/>
One hundred percent of prompts, in-tenant. Zero bytes out. Fifteen times the velocity of offshore baseline.
<break time="500ms"/>
<mark name="b7_point"/>
Your leverage is your code. Stop giving it away.
<break time="900ms"/>
<mark name="b8_cta"/>
Schedule an enterprise briefing at OutcomeOps dot A I today.
<break time="500ms"/>
</speak>
